# Cursor Rules for FeralFile App

# This file helps Cursor understand the codebase context

# Additional codebases to index

additional_codebases:

- path: /Users/nguyenphuocsang/Bitmark/ff-indexer-v2
  name: FF Indexer Server (Go)
  languages: [go]

- path: /Users/nguyenphuocsang/Bitmark/ffos-user
  name: FFOS User

## Project Context

This is a Flutter mobile app that communicates with a Go-based indexer server.
The server API documentation and models are in the ff-indexer-v2 repository.

## Code Style

- Always use Feral File engineering voice for messages/UI
- Write all code and comments in English
- Respond to users in Vietnamese

## Important Directories

- lib/gateway/: API clients for communicating with backend
- lib/service/: Business logic layer
- lib/model/: Data models that should match server types
- lib/screen/: UI screens and views

## Testing

- Unit tests in test/unit-tests/
- Use mocktail for mocking
- Follow existing test patterns in test/unit-tests/
